---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant V as Viewer
    participant E as CloudFront edge location
    participant O as Origin (S3 bucket / EC2)
    V->>E: GET d111.cloudfront.net/images/image.jpg
    alt file cached and within its expiration period
        E-->>V: served from the edge cache
    else not cached or expired (default check after 24 h)
        E->>O: fetch over a persistent connection
        Note over E,O: simultaneous requests for the same file<br/>are collapsed into one origin request
        O-->>E: image.jpg + Cache-Control header
        E-->>V: image.jpg, cached for later viewers
    end
